land-atlas/colorado/prowers-county"],["ARC or PLC in Prowers County","/arc-plc/colorado/prowers-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record in Prowers County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids, February to March came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2026 so far, March to April came in at 8% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 21412 had its driest year in 1956 at 49% of normal.</p>"}
